# Skill bodies are withheld from the public repo. Everything else in this
# folder — contracts, fixtures, reports, methodology — is committed.
*/SKILL.md

# Raw Mind replies from live eval runs. Generated, and they contain the Skill's
# actual output.
*/.runs/

# Generated from `--dry`. Regenerate on demand; committing it recreates the
# stale-prompt problem it exists to solve.
*/prompts.txt

# Build requests sent to a Mind. They quote the Skill body in full, so they are
# the Skill body wearing a different filename.
*/email-*

*/report.md
*/critical.md
*/learnings.md
